cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Hanner-Hydra: multiplication-free competing kernels from Hanner polytopes for time series classification"
abstract: >-
  Code for Hanner-Hydra, a variant of the Hydra time series classifier in which each
  group of competing convolutional kernels is the vertex set of a Hanner polytope, so
  that the winner of a group is found without multiplications. Includes the NumPy
  reference implementation, Numba kernels, aeon-compatible estimators, the
  pre-registration and all experiment and analysis scripts.
authors:
